---
description: 'classDef, class, the ::: shorthand and style on entities and a subgraph'
---
erDiagram
  classDef hot fill:#ffd6d6,stroke:#cc0000,color:#660000
  classDef cool fill:#d6e8ff,stroke:#0050cc
  CUSTOMER:::hot ||--o{ ORDER : places
  ORDER {
    int id PK
    string status
  }
  class ORDER cool
  ORDER }|--|{ PRODUCT : lists
  subgraph Store
    PRODUCT
  end
  style PRODUCT fill:#fff3c4,stroke:#b38f00,stroke-width:3px
  style Store fill:#f0fff0,stroke:#2e7d32
